      "Title": {
        "type": "string",
        "value": "Discover Ol Donyo Sabuk",
        "valueByLocale": {}
      },
      "Excerpt": {
        "type": "formattedText",
        "value": "<p dir=\"auto\">A day trip to Buffalo Mountain — wildlife, waterfalls and hiking just 85km from the hotel.</p>",
        "valueByLocale": {}
      },
      "Body": {
        "type": "formattedText",
        "value": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Buffalo Mountain</h3><p dir=\"auto\">Ol Donyo Sabuk (Kilimambogo) is a lush national park where elephants, Cape buffalo, baboons and 45+ bird species roam freely. Three waterfalls and the historic MacMillan burial site await at the summit.</p><h3 dir=\"auto\">Getting There</h3><p dir=\"auto\">The park is approximately 85km from Tea Tot Hotels. Our concierge can arrange transport and guided day trips.</p>",
        "valueByLocale": {}
      },
      "Author": {
        "type": "string",
        "value": "Tea Tot Hotels",
        "valueByLocale": {}
      },
      "Published Date": {
        "type": "date",
